# 3D assets.
# The OPTIMIZED model MUST be committed: Vercel builds from this repo, and if the
# .glb is absent ModelLoader's HEAD probe 404s and the PLACEHOLDER CUBE ships to
# production. At 25 MB it is well under GitHub's 100 MB limit.
# Raw/intermediate models (the 358 MB source) stay out — they live in Drive.
public/models/*
!public/models/plant-v*.glb

.vercel
